#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:1 699e1442ba624364abc04d8184ae97c5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:3 28f35c539b774d21a8e4251700707c58
msgid ""
"This guide walks you through setting up InnoClaw locally for development "
"or self-hosting."
msgstr "本指南将引导您在本地搭建 InnoClaw，用于开发或自托管。"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:5 f3537f60a8aa4bba9a0f8290633ba20f
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置要求"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:7 f047173977b8445d91730c7c442573b1
msgid "Before you begin, ensure you have the following installed:"
msgstr "在开始之前，请确保已安装以下软件："

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 71877269ce074aafb24f1cffac281aa9
#: f45b3e238a1f4cc2b7925d476279f95e
msgid "Requirement"
msgstr "要求"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md dde7176b66204586844e0ed7ff27b3fa
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 9d8d9d75a96f412a9bc0dea95dea7125
#: ee1b10fb94a54a20801369226023152a
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md d18f74362fdf4f88aaaab07e5e0fc60f
msgid "**Node.js**"
msgstr "**Node.js**"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 20efb8cf460f4d4d9f1b271cc8268046
msgid "24+ LTS recommended, 25 Current supported"
msgstr "推荐使用 24+ LTS，也支持 25 Current"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 474a55e75e25484d85bad9832d9d29bf
msgid "Runtime environment"
msgstr "运行时环境"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 8ab53fa9d0f443baa6805a11051a9087
msgid "**npm**"
msgstr "**npm**"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 4a5e0f7daedc4b35886651a8590c2b29
msgid "Included with Node.js"
msgstr "随 Node.js 一同安装"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 3d8113e064d74dad9a72ad5633873e2a
msgid "Package manager"
msgstr "包管理器"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 4350ba1d62844a5b97ce0b80b2482ab4
msgid "**Git**"
msgstr "**Git**"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md d860ed54c56043ecbe83554eced794bd
msgid "Any recent version"
msgstr "任意较新版本"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 7180a54d122c40bc80a6e07e16597120
msgid "Required for GitHub clone/pull features"
msgstr "GitHub 克隆/拉取功能所需"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:15 3c4e83bb1ba345d39ef98392855020ae
msgid "Optional:"
msgstr "可选："

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 26b9393f93614c0d8f9d3d318e5a2d1e
msgid "**AI API Key**"
msgstr "**AI API 密钥**"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md 20681fe217784643a43859962d8d97f9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"At least one (OpenAI, Anthropic, or Gemini) for AI chat and note "
"generation"
msgstr "AI 对话和笔记生成至少需要一个（OpenAI 或 Anthropic）"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md f2276dfb155e411fbdeed53cd55220a1
msgid "**GitHub Token**"
msgstr "**GitHub Token**"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md bceadca3c80f4bb4a96bcfe4b89a5a03
msgid "For cloning/pulling private repositories"
msgstr "用于克隆/拉取私有仓库"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:22 bc787d76025742d594aff75c6278f63a
msgid "Step 1: Clone the Repository"
msgstr "步骤 1：克隆仓库"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:29 8b997a0126624bf3a614d4d9fcd79882
msgid "Step 2: Install Dependencies"
msgstr "步骤 2：安装依赖"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:35 35fdf4c39e8d40df9c6437b73e18a74a
msgid ""
"This installs all required Node.js packages including Next.js, the AI "
"SDK, database drivers, and UI components."
msgstr "这将安装所有必需的 Node.js 包，包括 Next.js、AI SDK、数据库驱动程序和 UI 组件。"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:37 331ddf0edca94893b66be4bb955e5bce
msgid "Step 3: Configure Environment Variables"
msgstr "步骤 3：配置环境变量"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:39 5ec328155a154744b45b3da1d6393412
msgid "Copy the example environment file and edit it:"
msgstr "复制示例环境文件并进行编辑："

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:45 479fe075b73a4899ae85140b4b2703d2
msgid "Edit `.env.local` with your configuration:"
msgstr "使用您的配置编辑 `.env.local`："

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:61 4bf183a061394256879279082cd96806
msgid ""
"See [Environment Variables](environment-variables.md) for a complete "
"reference of all available options."
msgstr "请参阅[环境变量](environment-variables.md)获取所有可用选项的完整参考。"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:63 404ed5d5e6274a4cb5488bf5b97806ec
msgid "Step 4: Create Workspace Directories"
msgstr "步骤 4：创建工作空间目录"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:65 015f88b006614aae874914185208a076
msgid ""
"Ensure the directories specified in `WORKSPACE_ROOTS` exist on your "
"system:"
msgstr "确保系统中存在 `WORKSPACE_ROOTS` 指定的目录："

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:77 e10394a847ec4308adaead7682bed7fa
msgid ""
"The application will **not** automatically create these directories. They"
" must exist before starting the server."
msgstr "应用程序**不会**自动创建这些目录。在启动服务器之前，这些目录必须已经存在。"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:80 17239515faab449f8816fc8c954b926c
msgid "Step 5: Initialize the Database"
msgstr "步骤 5：初始化数据库"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:82 4d5dc24937254ce99fbd0c0257ae7bfc
msgid "Run the database migration to create the SQLite database:"
msgstr "运行数据库迁移以创建 SQLite 数据库："

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:88 faa0c3c9305046a395d003827a3cf180
msgid ""
"This creates the database file at `./data/innoclaw.db` with all required "
"tables."
msgstr "这将在 `./data/innoclaw.db` 创建包含所有必需表的数据库文件。"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:90 14886ceb859b4acf9dbc653ec39d841d
msgid "Step 6: Start the Development Server"
msgstr "步骤 6：启动开发服务器"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:96 15ac011c4c274eeaa6442ab9ab1ba7d3
msgid ""
"Open your browser and navigate to **http://localhost:3000** to start "
"using InnoClaw."
msgstr "打开浏览器并访问 **http://localhost:3000** 即可开始使用 InnoClaw。"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:98 8335cc6ebcc34a679382f0cc51fed288
msgid "Verifying Your Setup"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:100 4476aaa5cfd34b04984397081c9eb251
msgid "After starting the server, you should be able to:"
msgstr "启动服务器后，您应该能够："

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:102 cac1cb1c29164d989764a8cd7cf9eea8
msgid "See the workspace list on the home page"
msgstr "在首页看到工作空间列表"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:103 791d422b54e94f3baf624348b25914d2
msgid "Create a new workspace from one of your configured root directories"
msgstr "从已配置的根目录之一创建新的工作空间"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:104 a790edac58574181a1a040d3edb2f646
msgid "Browse and manage files in the workspace"
msgstr "在工作空间中浏览和管理文件"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:105 859162409bdb4a48978a468f7108f11f
msgid ""
"If an API key is configured, chat with AI about your files (after "
"clicking \"Sync\")"
msgstr "如果已配置 API 密钥，可以就您的文件与 AI 进行对话（点击\"同步\"后）"

#: ../../getting-started/installation.md:108 0e39ac8005e34ff9952909c782002d45
msgid ""
"If you don't configure any API keys, workspace management, file browsing,"
" uploading, editing, and GitHub cloning features will still work. Only AI"
" chat and note generation will be disabled."
msgstr "如果您未配置任何 API 密钥，工作空间管理、文件浏览、上传、编辑和 GitHub 克隆功能仍然可用。只有 AI 对话和笔记生成功能会被禁用。"
